      'mastered).\n\nAt zero we are routed. Whatever the outcome, the more resolve we have lost the more regiments are destroyed: '
      f'§Y{int(R.LOSS_SHARE["victory"] * 100)}%§! of that share in a victory, §Y{int(R.LOSS_SHARE["withdraw"] * 100)}%§! in a '
      f'withdrawal, §Y{int(R.LOSS_SHARE["defeat"] * 100)}%§! in a rout, infantry first.')

    L(V('army'), 'Army here: §Y[Root.DA_LE_inf.GetValue]§! infantry, §Y[Root.DA_LE_cav.GetValue]§! cavalry, '
                 '§Y[Root.DA_LE_art.GetValue]§! artillery   Strength §Y[Root.DA_LE_strength_show.GetValue]§!')
