    L(V('magic_ruler'), 'Magic: our ruler in person')
    L(V('magic_estate'), 'Magic: the battle mages of the estate   Mana §Y[Root.DA_LE_mana_show.GetValue]§!')
    L(V('magic_none'), 'Magic: none. Steel will have to do.')
    L(V('magic_tt'),
      'One spell can be cast each round, from any school someone on our side knows. A school cannot be cast two rounds running.\n\n'
      '§YOur ruler§!, if he is a powerful mage and fights in person, casts at his own level in the school and at full strength, '
